r or an invitation by or on behalf of Bank of America to any person to buy \nor sell any security or financial instrument or engage in any banking service. Nothing in these materials constitutes investment, legal, accounting or tax advice. \nCopyright 2026 Bank of America Corporation. All rights reserved.",
